        "text": "Google Search & other revenues increased $26.4 billion from 2024 to 2025. The overall growth was driven by interrelated factors including increases in search queries resulting from growth in user adoption and usage on mobile devices; growth in advertiser spending; and improvements we have made in ad formats and delivery.",
